WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
An operator describes a streetlight inspection in natural language.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Aeros checks readiness and prepares six missions for operator review.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Approved assignments execute across two fleet providers.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
A wind change affects two assignments. Aeros proposes an operator-approved recovery.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
The mission completes with coverage, observations, and decision history. All data is simulated.
